# Debugging a scene
@scenario tutorial_lesson_12
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip guide curious]
pip: To reproduce a scene bug, record the script, the line, and the choices that led there.
pip: Change one pose. Compare starting at that line with playing through it from the beginning.
> Review question -> check
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label check
pip: Which report makes a scene bug reproducible?
> A screenshot of the project folder. -> retry
> The script, source line and exact preceding choice. -> correct
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
[show pip guide curious]
pip: The same state and cursor give the reviewer a repeatable starting point. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip guide cheer]
pip: The same state and cursor give the reviewer a repeatable starting point.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_12]
[flag tutorial_done_12]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_6]
